# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.
screen Home
  inbox
  me: identity, person
  list People: everyone; shows knows, member, listed, proposed, delivered, vote_for, vote_against, delivered_vote, delivered_decision; opens Person
  list steward: atoms of steward
  list proposal: atoms of proposal
  list decided: atoms of decided
  list voted: atoms of voted
  list passed: atoms of passed
  list rejected: atoms of rejected
  Establish
  Acquaint: Bob = field
  Introduce: Bob = pick of knows, Carol = pick of knows
  Found: Delos = field
  Join: Bob = pick of knows, Delos = pick of steward
  Propose: Alice = pick of member, Prop = field, Delos = pick of member
  Propose own: Prop = field, Delos = pick of member
  Vote for: Alice = pick of member, Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of member
  Vote own for: Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of member
  Vote against: Alice = pick of member, Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of member
  Vote own against: Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of member
  Pass: Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of steward
  Reject: Prop = pick of proposal, Delos = pick of steward

screen Person(p)
  inbox
  p: knows, member, listed, proposed, delivered, vote_for, vote_against, delivered_vote, delivered_decision
